[{"client_msg_id":"fbe3bf0a-a444-4217-bedc-d55f2b1f84f5","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"すかね。。","ts":"1617109741.184600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4BM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7f6fab90-09b8-468a-bbf5-72842b496929","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"Linuxの種別の違いによる初期化やら結果反映の挙動とかの違いかなあ?","ts":"1617107082.184400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"evO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2abc1043-4210-4075-9705-db114756dba8","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"hashさんのやつ、なぜか治らなくて\nTwitterで教えてもらったやつで治った\n\u003chttps://forum.odroid.com/viewtopic.php?t=40287\u003e\n```sudo tee /etc/modprobe.d/snd-hda-intel-fix.conf \u0026lt;\u0026lt;\u0026lt;'options snd-hda-intel probe_mask=1'```","ts":"1617106754.183900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HjP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"89A8462C-F0F2-4A52-AE24-60DF30AE0D9A","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"バッテリーでも同じ現象になりました","ts":"1617105646.183200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PfT+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c1592daa-451a-41f8-9519-dafcfa593f14","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ケーブルつないで出たので、次はケーブル繋げないで出るか確認してみます","ts":"1617103457.182700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IWGyX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"50b69335-d3c6-4836-a884-3885c1e81a37","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"バッテリー駆動時に省電力モードが動作するような設定になってる可能性が高そうなので","ts":"1617102825.182200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SX9L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43b775e0-eed3-485e-97d2-358df64f37ef","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"先に電源ケーブルをつないで変化するか見たほうがいいかもですね","ts":"1617102780.181400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BOr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"34ebcb84-96b8-4550-b520-73b3046dbd23","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ありがとう御座います\nちょっとコマンド試してみます\nちなみに、ノートでDELLのVPSです","ts":"1617102581.180900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uAy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83a9f4f4-248c-4be5-aeb1-35dd38dba1a9","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"最近OS周りばっかやってるから多少詳しくなってる気がする自分","ts":"1617101530.179100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3c9h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"110457dc-d7af-4d83-8e81-dde92bf9fe97","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"last cmd=0x00170500\nとかゴリラさんと同じコマンドでエラーが起きてるっぽい","ts":"1617101505.178200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e2RA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0D4206A2-1DAF-4709-91BB-8792E797DC76","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"ありがとうございます:sob:","ts":"1617101500.178100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ajk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31e6fb20-c16e-4e54-b1ce-1ffd72e7be17","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"多分同じだと思いますよ","ts":"1617101466.177300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2nH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"641D44CB-877F-40F8-BCB9-FB699827EFAE","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"`[ 1256.107813] uvcvideo: Failed to query (SET_CUR) UVC control 4 on unit 1: -32 (exp. 4).\n[ 1256.107892] uvcvideo 1-1:1.0: reset_resume error -84\n[ 1259.253366] snd_hda_intel 0000:00:1f.3: azx_get_response timeout, switching to polling mode: last cmd=0x00170500\n[ 1260.265369] snd_hda_intel 0000:00:1f.3: No response from codec, disabling MSI: last cmd=0x00170500\n[ 1261.227843] reboot: Power down`\n私のとこで発生してるのとは別かもしれない、、\n社のnucで起きてるので明日試してみます","ts":"1617101049.176900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fVhH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1bea30e2-b4d5-4e7c-b9f0-e7bfcee3d439","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"`powertop` で手当たり次第に省電力化を試していたときに似たようなログを見た記憶があったので、それっぽいですね","ts":"1617100632.175300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":2,"users":["U01AQ5BFNLX","U01HXNSLCH5"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5U0A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"749a67b2-c2fe-4526-8c43-53e6a9b9b88d","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"intelCPUの省電力機能が働いてそう","ts":"1617100575.173900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lx4Mv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f52b4971-30d5-4f76-bf7a-f2a5e26ff776","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"ちなみに、自分のデスクトップ（Ubuntu20.04）では再現しませんでした","ts":"1617100551.173200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9eEgj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"de60e993-ad4e-4c96-aaba-aaf00d0beb33","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"今までの会話と、この解決方法から推測するに、emteeさんの言う通り省電力機能が働いてそうだから、多分ノートPCだと思うので\n• 一度電源ケーブルを接続した状態、してない状態のどちらでも同じログが出るか\n• 出るなら、コマンドを入れてみる\nで解決しそう","ts":"1617100517.172400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xAryK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"77cb3984-8fdb-49f9-98c1-c875f36086ad","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"↑参考記事です","ts":"1617100025.170300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rhB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24818a59-89d4-412d-b374-73c036b41b07","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"\u003chttps://bugzilla.kernel.org/show_bug.cgi?id=205229\u003e","ts":"1617100013.169600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3lH2x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f1ee0d9a-3ebe-491e-92c9-172556a3e2cf","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"`options snd_hda_intel power_save=0` を `/etc/modprobe.d/audio_powersave.conf'`に入れると治るらしい","ts":"1617100004.169400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"subara","count":3,"users":["U011FTGJ3SN","U81LLJ340","U01HXNSLCH5"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=kEyZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"259bf008-cc09-426b-9b8a-600e182f0bcc","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"なんらかの省電力機能の影響？（あくまでも推測です）","ts":"1617099832.168600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BMCjq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf580ef8-acc0-4ae4-a0d4-7e93463ef121","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"多分カーネルのせいかな？","ts":"1617099816.168500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AQSy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"64FA2C15-D9E6-4065-AF1D-8905503D143A","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"僕も20.04から出るようになりました","ts":"1617099613.167500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f9="}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b1a4602-ba66-4460-b4be-78d1ff1f969f","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"サウンドデバイス周りがおかしい？","ts":"1617099340.166600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RUjY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A02E7691-13CE-4585-B9AE-B9A216B49316","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/gorilla0513/status/1376839051832033281?s=21|https://twitter.com/gorilla0513/status/1376839051832033281?s=21\u003e","ts":"1617099171.166200","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/gorilla0513|@gorilla0513\u003e: ubuntu、シャットダウンしようとするとこうなるんだけど、原因不明 \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/ExuD0GGVcAYaOCq.jpg\u0